  <header class="page">
    <p class="crumb"><a href="{{ "/projects/" | relative_url }}">Projects</a></p>
    <h1>Sensing Place: Mapping the Physical Environment</h1>
    <p class="dek">Methods for measuring land cover from volunteered geographic information, and for validating, updating, and explaining the global products on which environmental exposure research depends.</p>
  </header>

  <div class="figrow">
    <figure class="fig-full">
